# Trivy ignore file — suppress accepted/mitigated CVEs
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN [# optional comment]
#
# Only add entries here after formal risk acceptance with:
#   - Justification
#   - Mitigation control
#   - Review date
#
# Example (do not add entries without the comment block):
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # Risk accepted: not exploitable in our threat model.
#                 # Mitigation: network isolation prevents external access.
#                 # Review: 2025-12-31
